X:5
T:Murphy's
T:Raheen Reel #3
R:reel
D:i.Paul Smyth and Michael Conney - Up  and Away ii. Kevin Burke - Up Close
B:Seamus Connolly - Forget Me Not
H:Kevin Burke included this previously untitled reel as one of three in his Raheen Medley, 3 tunes which he had learned from the Murphy Brothers of Wexford. Apparently the Murphy brothers had heard the tune at a fleadh in Dingle. According to Jackie Daly the source was likely another Murphy, Denis Murphy of Co. Kerry. Hence the title
